Date: Wed, 18 Jul 2018 00:40:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] RMF: Rework read pipeline. Remove RasterIO(GF_Read...) call
 from IWriteBlock.

---
 gdal/frmts/rmf/rmfdataset.cpp | 674 +++++++++++++++-------------------
 gdal/frmts/rmf/rmfdataset.h   |   8 +-
 gdal/frmts/rmf/rmfjpeg.cpp    |   7 +-
 3 files changed, 313 insertions(+), 376 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gdal/frmts/rmf/rmfdataset.cpp b/gdal/frmts/rmf/rmfdataset.cpp
index 5a4502923e0c..20143507caf6 100644
--- a/gdal/frmts/rmf/rmfdataset.cpp
